      en: ["The lake is situated at an average of 45 meters below sea level.", "The surface area fluctuates between 265 and 375 km² based on rainfall.", "The salinity of the water can be up to three times higher than seawater.", "It is home to the only permanent crocodile population on Hispaniola.", "Isla Cabritos is the largest of three islands located within the lake.", "The lake was officially designated as a national park in 1974."],
